    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/bfbc047646d96272f8dd966e8f1739e6.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br><strong>\u3010Game Introduction\u3011</strong> <br>Embark on a journey as the wandering swordsman Corinne in this 2D side-scrolling action game! Slay evil monsters,<br>rescue the enslaved, and watch your back! If you fall prey to the monsters they will show no mercy to you and your companions!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/c7eda49c00290e76bf16bc0da309466f.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3Stage Selection Screen<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/1372bb07a1da9882677ba34e2cbb3fea.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/1a806f5ed3112741ab569ea4c77071aa.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3Collect GEMs while adventuring. You can spend GEMs to upgrade abilities or obtain items!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/890817d7b1f006bd825b1473f28016e4.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3Learn new skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/becdb98d12a6f96f9de0bbec9ef6ee02.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3You might find food along the way to restore your health...!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/13ac138c1096a65549c751c0dfadb369.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3BOSS Battle!<br><br><strong>\u3010Game Contents\u3011</strong><br>Explore a world where both enemies and allies face lewd, hardcore humiliation.<br>Uncover various H-scenes based on your gameplay style and demise.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/ed1fef268a6da94b68a3a73a21eb12cd.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3When you're out of HP, watch out for the goblins loitering near you...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/4db136d24be2b1e963fc204e4b25fa99.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3Immerse yourself in H-animations with multiple viewing modes and the ability to zoom in at any time!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311840/extras/c204f1801498c1a8e0a2c8d444deb4b3.avif?t=1725000823\" /></span><br>\u3000\u25b3You might get a GAME OVER screen, but things might look different depending on your conditions!<br>Experience a total of 4 stages, 16 CG images, and 33 types of H-animations!<br><br>*All content within the game is uncensored.*",
